meta {
  name: 01_RequestAndReject
  seq: 1
}

docs {
  Scenario: A public sector system user requests a package and the organisation rejects it

    Given the recipient has no pending request from the system user
    When the system user requests the package from the recipient by organisation number
    Then the request is pending with the system user as sender
    And the recipient sees the request among its received requests
    When the recipient rejects the request
    Then the request is no longer pending for the recipient
}
